# Black Ward's protection from black removes other black Auras from the creature (CR 702.16c, 704.5m) but not Black Ward
# itself (CR 702.16n: "This effect doesn't remove this Aura"). Bot1's Devoted Hero wears Fear (black) first; when Black
# Ward resolves on it, state-based actions put Fear into the graveyard and Ward stays. Painter's Servant then names
# black, so Black Ward is itself black (CR 105.3) and still protects from black: it stays attached.

